{{ProductPage|http://www.sharp-cee.com/cps/rde/xchg/scee/hs.xsl/-/html/product_details.htm?product{{!!}}ANWUD630&cat{{!!}}111}} :[http://www.sharp-cee.com/cps/rde/xbcr/documents/documents/Marketing/Datasheet/pdf_DS_Datasheet_ANWUD630_sp_eq.pdf Datasheet]
This device would seem likely to be an [[Alpha Networks WUS-N11]].. which is AR9271 based. The same stick is used by '''Philips''' as the [[Philips WUB1110|WUB1110]] / [[Philips PTA01|PTA01]] (.. the USB ID is almost certainly different though, it isn't likely to work with '''Sharp''' stuff if they locked it to their ID only).
{{WiFiCert|WFA19627|05/06/2013}}
